{"id":"chips","lemma":"chips","pos":"noun","rank":3362,"glosses":["chips (American English), crisps (British English)"],"ipa":"/ʃips/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Mecanautes-chips.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Mecanautes-chips.wav.mp3","gender":"mf","examples":[{"text":"J'ai mangé des chips.","en":"I ate potato chips.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334271","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Tout le monde aime les chips.","en":"Everyone likes potato chips.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"everyone, everybody"]]},{"text":"Tom mange des chips.","en":"Tom is eating potato chips.","words":[null,{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Je n'aurais pas dû manger le sac complet de chips.","en":"I shouldn't have eaten the whole bag of potato chips.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bag, sack"},{"g":"full"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Si je me mets à manger des chips, je ne sais pas m'arrêter.","en":"If I start eating potato chips, I can't stop.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to stop"}],"phrases":[[8,12,"I don't know"]]}]}